Z||000000||Greg Piet||08-29-99||09:14 PM||||I found a site that described the fiero vs other vehicles.  It has a few different fieros in it.  I have no idea how accurate they are, but the best fiero on this piece of paper is the 85 SE except for an 84 SD-4 (whatever that is).  I find this hard to believe since I have an 85 SE, and although it is quick it is just screaming for a 5th gear.<p>
